From d01a9fabe6f31f566f7588bf07e8c7928993a5d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 45/58] urltest: the group of this fork, in a package of its
 own

The urltest group of podkop-engine in protocol/group/urltestgroup, registered for the type urltest
in place of upstream's (protocol/group/urltest.go stays as upstream has it): one tester for all
groups, several URLs and the median of a cycle, a member left when its connections fail, a download
test before a switch, fallbacks, the modes loss and balance, tests out of turn, the network monitor;
the history keeps what it needs beyond a delay in common/urltest/history_detail.go.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  f3ccd0af8 urltest: test each member every interval, not every other one
  e208a688f urltest: leave a member when its connections fail, not at the next test
  7d9860cac urltest: download 64 KiB through a member before switching to it
  f173a8b74 urltest: a timeout that also reports itself closed is the member's failure
  417fbd46d urltest: test a member out of turn when a connection gets no answer
  bafd7d150 urltest: take the download test URL from the group's download_url
  6384c52ef urltest: fallbacks, taken in their order while no outbound answers
  3ff536dae urltest: the Clash API's delay test does not wait for nested selections
  5c4934e6c urltest: check the download URL of the environment at start
  68de9f632 urltest: keep the test results through a network pause, test again after a busy round
  a754f992a urltest: one error for a failed dial, naming the member
  590c70ce9 urltest: a dial this host's network refused waits for the network monitor
  04648cd64 urltest: failures across a change of the network, a monitor that sees no route
  41f832ef9 patches: adapt to sing-box 1.14.4
  6197fb6fb urltest: fallbacks without outbounds, block as a fallback, a bound on tests at once
  829c42a05 urltest: no fallback before a round has tested the outbounds
  f7cb7f2ab urltest: what the review of r20 found
  317bc0304 clashapi: the fallbacks of a URL test are told apart
  48e4fbe65 urltest: one tester for all groups, several URLs, median of a cycle
  aabe0bb42 urltest: retry a round with a URL that answered through the member
  a2d7a6967 urltest: modes loss and balance, loss counted from the packets of a probe
  e7034df02 urltest: a probe the URL failed holds no member back; one member a device
  64e6aa66b urltest: the balance is logged as text; the tests of the modes log for real
  242cb1b8b urltest: an idle device of a balance is hashed again
  2128f4ce7 urltest modes: the fixes of the review
  cecda2b02 urltest: the group in a package of its own, upstream's file as upstream has it
  a9a09bdef urltest: what the history keeps of a tag beyond its delay, in a file of its own

